  "description": "Our all new high performance light weight race bike\n\nAn evolution. The new Vitus Vitesse EVO features a ground up rethink on what's required from an elite level lightweight race bike. Refined Race-Fit geometry including a longer top tube, lower front end and shorter chain stays gives the perfect balance of fit and control, whatever the race demands. A refined carbon layup result in Vitus' lightest and stiffest road frameset ever - 10% lighter and 34% stiffer than it's predecessor. Build in the increased tyre clearances and modern look, and this bike just wants to be ridden hard.\n\nFeaturing the ultra reliable Shimano 105 groupset, with hydraulic disc brakes and semi-compact gearing. A 32T cassette and long cage rear deraileur ensure you can tackle the highest mountain passes or go head to head in your local crit.\n\nFitted with Prime's Baroudeur aluminium tubeless ready wheels, and Schwalbe Pro ONE Performance TLE tyres, all that's needed to go tubeless is sealant. To complement the 105 groupset, the bike is finished off with Prime's Doyenne aluminium bar and Doyenne lightweight stem.\n\nRace-Fit geometry\n\nSL UD Carbon frame and fork with integrated seat clamp\n\nShimano 105 R7000 groupset\n\nPrime Barodeur wheelset\n\nSchwalbe ONE Performance 700c x 25 tyres\n\nPrime finishing kit",
